    "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:50Z",
    "body": "Would this make available the same content that is already available via `fetch()`? Is it possible to use CSP (`connect-src `?) to restrict these imports?",
