    "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:29Z",
    "body": "Do we actually want a `text` destination? We added one for `json` because it's a specific format, but in most cases a text import will then be parsed by something else. `fetch` uses an empty destination because, similarly, we don't actually know how its result is going to be used.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
