    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T17:47:02Z",
    "body": "It's specific in that we can ask the server for JSON with `Accept: application/json` (and we do).\r\n\r\nGiven that the destination is exposed these days through `Sec-Fetch-Dest` as well it would probably be useful to have a dedicated value here as well. `text` seems fine to me.",
