    "created_at": "2026-03-24T19:14:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-24T19:14:50Z",
    "body": "@eemeli can you detail how this PR addresses the concerns you've linked to in https://github.com/tc39/proposal-import-text/issues/8?\r\n\r\nThe PR description says they should be addressed in this PR. Maybe they are? It would be good to flesh it out.\r\nSeems to me from this PR that response bytes for text imports are always decoded as UTF-8. Perhaps it needs to verify that the mime-type is textual as well, so that it doesn't try to UTF8-decode some binary response?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
